      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/_GlobalCrisis_/status/1980702802180726870",
      "text": "🇵🇭 🌀 Aftermath of Tropical Storm “Ramil” in the Philippines\n\nAt least seven people have died, and several others remain missing after Tropical Storm Ramil swept through the Philippines.\n\n🌧️ Heavy rainfall caused the Jacopon River to overflow in Daram, Samar Province, leading to severe flooding and destruction.\n\n🚨 Rescue teams continue search and recovery operations in the affected areas.\n\n📅 October 19, 2025\n🎥 *Video: Joe Patente*\n\nSource: Geól. Sergio Almazán\n / @chematierra via @ABSCBNNews\n\n‼️🌍  Anomalous floods and landslides are happening more frequently around the globe. Almost every day, we report on several such occurrences. What is the reason? What do the statistics say? For answers to these questions and many others about the manifestation of natural disasters, read the report ON THE PROGRESSION OF CLIMATIC DISASTERS ON EARTH AND THEIR CATASTROPHIC CONSEQUENCES\n🔴 https://t.co/17otvN8FyZ\n\n#CreativeSociety #GlobalCrisis\n#Responsibility #ActNow #SPEAKUP\n#Philippines #RamilPH #TropicalStorm #Flooding #Samar #Daram #Weather #Climate #NaturalDisaster\n#climate #anomaly  #weather #destruction #climatechange",
